# SvgEditorModal.ascii
# Full-screen SVG editor modal with header, canvas, toolbar, layers, and nav overlay

+----------------------------------------------------------+
| [.svg-editor-modal: fixed inset 0, z-300, flex column]   |
|                                                          |
| +------------------------------------------------------+ |
| | [header: card-bg, border-bottom]                     | |
| |  "SVG Editor"  filename       [save] [undo][redo][X] | |
| +------------------------------------------------------+ |
|                                                          |
| +------------------------------------------------------+ |
| | @LayersPanel.vue (collapsible panel)                 | |
| +------------------------------------------------------+ |
|                                                          |
| +------------------------------------------------------+ |
| | [.canvas-container: flex 1, bg #e5e7eb]              | |
| |                                                      | |
| |   @SvgCanvas.ascii                                   | |
| |                                                      | |
| +------------------------------------------------------+ |
|                                                          |
| +------------------------------------------------------+ |
| | @Toolbar.vue (tool buttons bar)                      | |
| +------------------------------------------------------+ |
|                                                          |
| [.nav-overlay: absolute, bottom 5rem, l/r 1rem]         |
|  [<] prev                   [🗑]? [>] next              |
|                              ^                           |
|                         delete-btn                       |
|                     (v-if hasSelection)                   |
+----------------------------------------------------------+

## Element Table

| ascii              | type     | attrs / notes                              | region  | cond                    |
|--------------------|----------|--------------------------------------------|---------|-------------------------|
| header             | header   | card-bg, flex space-between                | top     | always                  |
| filename           | span     | text-muted, 0.875rem                       | header  | always                  |
| save indicator     | span     | saving/saved/error states                  | header  | saveStatus !== 'idle'   |
| undo btn           | button   | editor.undo()                              | header  | always (disabled state) |
| redo btn           | button   | editor.redo()                              | header  | always (disabled state) |
| close btn          | button   | handleClose()                              | header  | always                  |
| canvas container   | div      | flex 1, overflow hidden                    | main    | always                  |
| nav prev           | NavButton| direction=-1, handleNavigate(-1)           | overlay | always (disabled state) |
| nav next           | NavButton| direction=1, handleNavigate(1)             | overlay | always (disabled state) |
| delete btn         | button   | circular red, trash icon, deleteSelected() | overlay | hasSelection            |
